    <help><![CDATA[
Liana Plotting Tools (`liana.pl`)
=================================

This tool provides the complete visualization suite for LIANA+ cell-cell communication and spatial analysis results (`liana 2.0.0`).

Available Methods
-----------------

- **dotplot**: Dotplot of interactions by source and target cell types.
- **dotplot_by_sample**: Dotplot of interactions faceted across samples/conditions.
- **tileplot**: Side-by-side ligand and receptor tiles colored and labeled by shared entity column suffixes (e.g., `means`, `props`, `stat`, `padj`).
- **circle**: Circular directed network graph of cell-cell communication counts or mean scores.
- **connectivity**: Spatial connectivity weights around a selected cell/spot index.
- **elbow**: NMF reconstruction error curve and estimated elbow rank.
- **feature_by_group**: Multi-colorbar spatial scatter plot comparing an Inflow `source^ligand^receptor` feature across receiver cell types.
- **annulus**: Concentric distance rings overlaid on tissue coordinates to inspect `radius_step` and `annulus_steps` for LRIC / cross-PCF.
- **lric_lineplot**: Distance enrichment curve `g(r)` (plus `g_pcf` and `g_expr` decomposition) for a specific interaction.
- **lric_divergence**: Visual comparison of two `log2 g(r)` curves with shaded divergence area and peak separation radius `r*`.
- **misty_target_metrics**: Bar/point or boxplot of MISTy target metrics (`gain_R2`, `intra_R2`, `multi_R2`, or custom view column).
- **misty_contributions**: Stacked barplot of view contributions per target from MISTy.
- **misty_interactions**: Heatmap of predictor-target interaction importances for a specific MISTy view.
    ]]></help>
    <expand macro="citations"/>
</tool>
